This problem was created by me in January 2010. My style at that time was to place a few stones casually and then start calculating. At first, without the 4th-line stone at m16, there was more than one way to kill. Later, I found that after adding the 4th-line stone, there is only one killing method. Now let's start with hints for the calculation thinking.
